# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Do not open a public issue for a security problem. Write to the maintainers of {{title}}
privately (fill in the address: `security@example.com`) with the steps to reproduce, the
affected version and what an attacker could do. You get an answer within five working days.

## Supported versions

Only the latest release gets security fixes.

## What CI checks

`cargo deny check` refuses dependencies with known advisories (RustSec) and licenses outside
`deny.toml`. Dependabot or Renovate opens weekly update pull requests.
